@host=https://localhost
@port=7280

### GET request to example server
GET {{host}}:{{port}}/

### Create user
POST {{host}}:{{port}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "EmailAddress": "example@mail.com",
  "Name": "example",
  "Password": "Password1!"
}

### Sign in
POST {{host}}:{{port}}/users/sign-in
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "EmailAddress": "example@mail.com",
  "Password": "Password1!"
}

### Sign out
GET {{host}}:{{port}}/users/sign-out
